// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/queen/views.t27 -- the Queen's project views: what a view may call the same thing, what it may
; call done, and how it says where a number came from and how old it is
; S10 of gHashTag/trinity#988 (gHashTag/t27#4829, re-filed from #3572). The site at t27.ai (gHashTag/trinity
; apps/website) shows specs, skills, crons, agents, tools, documents and a hive of issues; the native app
; (apps/queen) shows none of them. Every number on those views comes from one of two places: a dated file the
; build ships (the spec manifest, the shared core, the universe atlas, the Queen's foundation) or a public
; endpoint of the trios supervisor read in the page's session. This file is the contract between those
; sources and the views: the identity of a repository, a source, a spec, a revision and an issue; the five
; kinds of evidence a view keeps apart; how an address that names a spec resolves and what is shown when it
; does not; how live, stale, offline, loading, unavailable and snapshot data are presented; what a view
; counts once and what it may call done. Every decision is a function the C and Zig backends execute,
; replayed against what the site's own code did (tools/trinity_queen_views.py):
;   ts       the site's pure TypeScript imported and called under node: address resolution, byte
;            verification, the shared core's identity and issue matching, the atlas, the HUD helpers
;   data     the public files the pinned build ships, read whole
;   live     GitHub on the day of measurement against those files: issue states the snapshot froze, the
;            epic's sub-issues, and one public answer of the supervisor's board
;   gates    every check, audit and test script of the site at the pin: run here, and whether CI runs it
;   browser  the built site in headless Chrome over CDP at desktop and phone sizes and with reduced
;            motion, every live endpoint answered from the recorded public snapshot
;   native   the Swift package of apps/queen built and tested at the pin
; Not measured: the deployed build (the pin is built here), a signed-in player, the GPU path of the hive
; renderer, anything behind a credential. ASCII only (L3).
; phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

module QueenViews;

