    "f68 No manifest entry carries a sha256 or a revision (0 of 1577), and 1484 name their repository by a bare name; the bytes are verified only when the address pins a hash, so a plain address loads unverified bytes although shared-core.json holds the sha256 of every source [ts; data]",
